{{// Current turn focus: re-injects the user's last message so the model answers it first and in full. WHEN: on if the model drifts or ignores part of your message; off if it already stays on track. }}{{trim}}
<current_turn>
{{user}}'s latest message, which this reply answers first and in full:
{{lastUserMessage}}
</current_turn>

{{// Last character message anchor: re-injects the character's previous reply near the turn so tone and continuity hold. WHEN: on if the model loses the thread between turns; off to save context. }}{{#if lastCharMessage}}
<context_anchor>
{{lastCharMessage}}
</context_anchor>
{{/if}}

